            <ArticleTitle>Diagnosis and treatment issues of chronic pelvic pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>200-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The diagnosis and management of pelvic pain presents a challenge to the medical practitioner. The approach should be systematic and organized to provide the best possible care. The aim of this article is to increase awareness among urologists so that they may be more able to understand and support their patients.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
